{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"agent_message","text":"I’ve confirmed the core biology from the cited literature: FCP is described as a meniscus fibrocartilage progenitor population marked by `COL1A1`, `COL3A1`, `MCAM/CD146`, and `MYLK`, with colony formation and osteogenic/adipogenic potential. Next I’m locking down the exact CL, UBERON, PR, and RO IDs already used in this ontology so the new term follows existing patterns."}}
